Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 06:48:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: debug mode for porting (speed, pause, rewind, saved
 states, jumps)

[CommonSettings] DebugMode (default false) or the DebugMenu game feature
turns on the porting tools, a "Porting" tab / window of the debug menu
(Chinese or English, switchable) and a status line. Three fingers at once
open the menu on touch screens; touches on a debug window do not reach the
game, the fingers of the gesture are lifted as canceled.

- Speed x1..x64 (several logic ticks per frame; the input of a frame counts
  in its first tick only, raw Input "went down" state cleared for the
  others), pause, single steps of 1 / 60 frames.
- Forced skip: the engine skip mode with "skip read only" off (put back
  after), SF_MESSKIP / SF_MESALLSKIP right before the VM runs, non looping
  movies stopped. "Skip movie" button.
- Rewind: a snapshot at every checkpoint (SetCheckpointId), taken when the
  checkpoint instruction is done and pointing the thread back to its start,
  so a restore runs it again (shows the line, sets the choices up). Kept 300
  (10..5000); back 1 / 10 lines or any line of the list. A snapshot holds
  ScrWork, FlagWork, the VM thread pool (Vm::SaveVmState / RestoreVmState:
  links as indices, groups, which script each buffer holds), the system
  textures the scripts loaded (SpriteLoader remembers archive and file) and
  SGHD the phone. A restore stops movies, empties the dialogue pages and the
  choices, reloads scripts and sprites, resyncs backgrounds, characters, BGM.
- Saved states: named, written next to the save file (debug-states.bin,
  ignored when the thread size of the build differs).
- Jump any thread (default the main one) to any label of any script, clear
  the call stack; restart the current script.
- Unlock CG, music, tips; write the save file.
- The debug menu window is never taller than the screen.

Generic; can go upstream (the SGHD phone part is behind IsSghd()).

Verified on MuMu (Android 15 x86_64 emulator, not a real device):
sg-pc (Steam data, 2018 Chinese patch): x8 / x64, forced skip from a new
game to chapter 1 in 55 s with all movies skipped, back 1 / 10 lines,
restart script, saved state loaded after a restart from the title.
mo6tw-pc-zhs: title menu at x8, forced skip stops at the first choice, back
to the choice after choosing, choose again, jump to sa01a label 10, unlock.

